{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"把 H1 的身体先紧、H40/H41 的急切后放松与留恋，以及 H3 的现在仍能站住，接成一个先于念头浮现、却不再完全支配他的旧反应，没有新增事件或改变主线。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"沿着 H19/H20 与 H29/H30/H36/H39/H41，把真实安宁带来的满足和无法保证其持续分开，说明悬空感来自整件事仍未被彻底安顿，而非安宁失效或音乐变化本身。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"用 H1 的未解之重和 H30/H36/H39/H41 中已经得到的快乐与正在发生的失去，解释旧问题为何以更具体、更沉重的形式重现，没有添加新前史或改变主线。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"三条都交代了当下感受及其心理来由，即使不看听感记录，也能理解旧的不确定如何在经历真实的幸福与失去感之后重新出现，并获得新的意义。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5420c992-550d-4f19-868f-cb3e5576cb9f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T184548696670Z", "elapsed_seconds": 92.094, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T18:47:20.803313+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8cbb84b15362bf03e229716cc2ecf88d653435b2c0978b8ff55588d89c4bc77a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "59688